<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal global trade deficit narrows Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Portugal global trade deficit narrows Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit narrowed to 1,193 billion escudos between January and October from 1,273 billion in the same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		   Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Oct 95     Oct	Sept</p>
<p> Overall balance  -1,193    -1,273	 -130     -132</p>
<p> Imports	     4,282     4,160	  465	424</p>
<p> Exports	     3,090     2,887	  335	292</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. 1995 figures are definitive while 1996 figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
